  "question": {
    "text": "An oil drop carrying a charge <math><mi>q</mi></math> has a mass <math><mi>m</mi></math> kg. It is falling freely in air with terminal speed <math><mi>v</mi></math>. The electric field required to make the drop move upwards with the same speed is"
